 "strings": {
  "It all started three years ago,\nright here in this center.": "",
  "And I'll bet you can guess when the Mole\nfirst appeared. About three years ago.": "",
  "You performed an AD-9 experiment\non Waku-san while he was asleep.": "",
  "Back then... while Waku-san was asleep,\nyou gave him a dose of AD-9.": "",
  "Probably late at night.": "",
  "Late at night, if I had to guess.": "",
  "And when he died, you did the only\nthing you could. Snuck him out.": "",
  "But when he died, you panicked and tried to\nsneak him out.": "",
  "You were probably thrilled with Okubo.": "",
  "You were probably thrilled\nwith Okubo.": "",
  "I mean, it's practically a miracle someone else\nstepped up and took the blame for you. Wouldn't you say?": "",
  "I mean, it's practically a miracle someone else stepped up\nand took the blame for you. Wouldn't you say?": "",
  "I don't know what you're\ntalking about.": "",
  "But then another miracle happened.\nOne not so convenient for you. Okubo walked.": "",
  "But then a less convenient miracle happened.\nOkubo was declared an innocent man.": "",
  "And if he was innocent, that would mean\nsomeone else killed Waku-san.": "",
  "They might have even come after you\nif you didn't do anything.": "",
  "They might have even come after you,\nif you didn't do anything to stop them.": "",
  "Which is when you sold\nyour soul to the devil.": "",
  "That's when you took the plunge.\nYou sold your soul to the devil.": "",
  "What do you mean by that...?": "",
  "What do you mean...?": "",
  "Don't play dumb with me.": "",
  "You know all too damn well\nwhat I'm talking about.": "",
  "You know damn well\nwhat I'm talking about.": "",
  "You needed to frame Okubo...\nand you murdered someone in cold blood to do it.": "",
  "In order to set Okubo up, you made your choice.\nYou murdered somebody in cold blood.": "",
  "Murder...?\nWho are you accusing me of killing?": "",
  "Murder...? Who would I have killed?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The person Shono killed to frame Okubo was...)</color>": "",
  "This man right here.": "",
  "Hey, hold on a sec.": "",
  "Hey, hold on a sec, Yagami-san.": "",
  "That's not the right person, Yagami-san.": "",
  "That's not the right person.": "",
  "Oh, ahem!": "",
  "In order to set Okubo up, you murdered\nsomebody in cold blood.": "",
  "Emi Terasawa. A coworker of yours,\nand Okubo's girlfriend.": "",
  "You forced your way into their\napartment, and murdered Emi.": "",
  "You forced your way into their apartment,\nand murdered Emi.": "",
  "According to the autopsy report,\nshe was stabbed at least fifteen times.": "",
  "The autopsy report said she was\nstabbed at least fifteen times.": "",
  "I didn't...": "",
  "Did she tell you Okubo-kun had been\ntaking pills to help him sleep at night?": "",
  "Did she tell you Okubo-kun had been taking\npills to help him sleep at night?": "",
  "Conveniently enough, he didn't wake up while\nyou were murdering his girlfriend.": "",
  "Luckily for you, he slept through\nyou murdering his girlfriend.": "",
  "Him smelling like booze was probably\nyour doing, too.": "",
  "That he reeked of liquor was\nprobably your doing, too.": "",
  "Lemme guess, you injected him with alcohol?": "",
  "Lemme guess, you injected Okubo\nwith alcohol?": "",
  "That'd raise his BAC no problem.": "",
  "And sure he could've died if you messed up,\nbut that wouldn't have mattered.": "",
  "And sure, he could've died if you messed up,\nbut that wouldn't have mattered.": "",
  "As long as you could chalk up Emi's murder\nto a drunk, suicidal Okubo-kun.": "",
  "As long as you could pin Emi's murder\non a drunk, suicidal Okubo-kun.": "",
  "Um. I'm going to go discuss\na few things with Ayabe-san.": "",
  "Um... I'm going to meet\nwith Ayabe-san.": "",
  "Yagami joining you?": "",
  "Good. Yagami joining you?": "",
  "No, I'm going alone. Yagami-san, well...\nHe may be keeping his distance for a while.": "",
  "He thinks the Mole might target him,\nso he doesn't want to get us involved.": "",
  "You should watch your\nback too, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "You should watch your back\ntoo, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Been a while since\nhe's been this distant.": "",
  "Tch, now he takes my advice?": "",
  "Knowing Yagami-san, he'll want to solve\nevery single incident related to AD-9.": "",
  "Knowing Yagami-san, he'll want to solve\nevery last incident related to AD-9.": "",
  "And if he does, maybe he can prove that Ayabe-san\nand Okubo-kun are innocent.": "",
  "Ayabe-san and Okubo-kun got wrapped up in this...\nbut he can prove both of them innocent.": "",
  "Clearing Shinpei Okubo's name this late on...\nYagami'd be a damn hero.": "",
  "I think he might enjoy that.": "",
  "Yeah, \"hero\" is hardly a big enough word.\nA legend is more like it!": "",
  "Yeah! Forget \"hero.\"\nHe'd be a legend!": "",
  "...Don't get ahead of yourself, kid.": "",
  "The bugs in the Matsugane office are still working,\njust like I said they'd be.": "",
  "Thought so. The bugs in the Matsugane office\nare still working, just like I said they'd be.": "",
  "Good. Can you hear anything?": "",
  "Just small talk.\nSounds like there are a ton of people in there.": "",
  "Just small talk.\nSounds like a ton of people in there.": "",
  "Hamura, too?": "",
  "Hamura, too? You hear him?": "",
  "Nah. Doubt it.": "",
  "Everyone'd be on edge with him in the house.\nNo chance of small talk.": "",
  "But Hamura's still gonna get\nin touch with them, right?": "",
  "But... Hamura's still gonna get in touch\nwith them, right?": "",
  "Mmm, maybe.": "",
  "Whaddya mean, maybe!?\nYou're the one who said he'd be calling 'em!": "",
  "\"Maybe\"!? You're the one\nwho said he'd be calling 'em!": "",
  "You don't gotta\nlose your shit over it.": "",
  "You don't gotta lose your shit over it.": "",
  "Ugh... Where the hell is he?": "",
  "Guess all we can do now is sit here and wait\n'til somebody spills the beans.": "",
  "Ah, well. Guess all we can do now is sit and wait\n'til somebody spills the beans on him.": "",
  "Can you at least put that shit out?\nYou're stinking up the whole van.": "",
  "Can you at least put that shit out?\nThe air already sucks in here.": "",
  "My bad.": "",
  "Whoops, bad habit.": "",
  "Yeah, bad habit. Sorry.": "",
  "Sorry, but you're just\ngonna have to deal.": "",
  "You can stick it out.": "",
  "Anyway. You're serious\nabout capturing Hamura, yeah?": "",
  "You're serious about capturing Hamura, yeah?": "",
  "Yeah. He's our only chance\nof finding the Mole.": "",
  "Yup. Hamura's our only chance\nof finding the Mole.": "",
  "We don't get Hamura, we lose.\nAyabe and Okubo are done for.": "",
  "If we don't get Hamura, then our case is finished.\nAyabe and Okubo are done for.": "",
  "I'm hearin' you, but sitting crammed\nin this damn car ain't gonna help us nab him.": "",
  "I hear you, but we're not gettin' anywhere\ncrammed in this damn car.": "",
  "Luckily, I have just the thing.": "",
  "Well... I might have just the thing.": "",
  "We'll spy on them from the sky.": "",
  "We'll spy on the Matsugane\nfrom the sky.": "",
  "The hell're you going, man?\nWe're supposed to be scoutin' the office.": "",
  "Hey, the hell're you going?\nWe're supposed to be scoutin' the office.": "",
  "Is that Higashi?": "",
  "Yup. Guy really thinks\nhe's hot shit, huh?": "",
  "Looks like. Guy really thinks\nhe's hot shit, huh?": "",
  "Heh, guess he's movin' up in the world.": "",
  "Heh. He's movin' up in the world.": "",
  "Maybe with Hamura gone he's been\nable to relax a little.": "",
  "With Hamura gone,\ndoes he call the shots?": "",
  "Hm? He's leaving.": "",
  "Hm? Look. Higashi's leaving.": "",
  "I'm gonna follow him. Better to split up\nthan all sit around in one place.": "",
  "I'm gonna follow Higashi.\nBetter to split up than all sit around in one place.": "",
  "I'll come with.\nMy legs're getting sore as shit in here.": "",
  "So what, I'm stuck here by myself?": "",
  "What? So I'm stuck here by myself?": "",
  "I'll switch with you later, promise.": "",
  "I'll switch with you later!": "",
  "(I need to find Higashi...)": "",
  "(I'll wait for Higashi to start moving.)": "",
  "Dude, you're too close!\nBack off a bit.": "",
  "Whoa, dude, you're too close!\nBack off a bit.": "",
  "Hey Tak...\nYou sure we can be out like this?": "",
  "Hey Tak... You sure we should be\nout in broad daylight?": "",
  "Good point. Shono could be sending\nhis assassin after us as we speak.": "",
  "Good point. Shono could be sending\nthe Mole after us right now.": "",
  "We could get attacked at any time.": "",
  "Heh, thought so.": "",
  "Where the hell's Higashi going?": "",
  "Where the hell you going, Higashi...?": "",
  "No clue... but he's alone now.\nWe could just walk up to him and ask.": "",
  "You know what? He's alone now.\nWe could just walk up to him and ask.": "",
  "You really think he's gonna listen to us?\nHaven't talked to him since our fight at that restaurant.": "",
  "You really think he's gonna listen to us?\nHaven't talked to him since our fight.": "",
  "Worst thing that happens is he says no.": "",
  "Huh, guess you got a point there.\nAll right, let's give it a shot.": "",
  "What the? He's bolting!": "",
  "Huh...? What the hell? He's boltin'!": "",
  "What, you done running?": "",
  "I wasn't running away.\nNot from you, anyway.": "",
  "...Guess so. But it wasn't you\nI was runnin' from.": "",
  "I just couldn't let the family\nsee us talking. You get it?": "",
  "If the family saw us talkin',\nwe'd both be screwed.": "",
  "So then you'll hear us out?": "",
  "So... you'll talk?": "",
  "Higashi... You fuckin'...": "",
  "He's not gonna run anymore.\nJust, take it easy, Kaito-san.": "",
  "He's done running.\nTake it easy, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Okay, look... Captain Hamura's throwing everything\nhe's got into catching the two of you.": "",
  "Captain Hamura's throwing everything he's got\ninto catching you two.": "",
  "Whole family's got orders to let him\nknow if you ever cross our path.": "",
  "Whole family's got orders.\nIf we see you, we contact him.": "",
  "Meaning if you called him now,\nhe'd come straight to us.": "",
  "Huh. Meaning if you called him now,\nhe'd come straight to us.": "",
  "And then what, huh?\nHe wants you dead, you know that, right?": "",
  "And then what, huh?\nHe wants you dead, you know that?": "",
  "Just tell me where he is.": "",
  "Just tell me where Hamura is.": "",
  "Nobody's told me. Honest.": "",
  "Listen. I'm not gonna rat\nabout seeing you here.": "",
  "Listen, I'm not gonna rat\nabout seeing you here.": "",
  "But if I were you, I'd consider\ngetting outta town. Real fast.": "",
  "But if I were you, I'd get\noutta town. And fast.": "",
  "Bet Matsugane-san would\nagree with me, too.": "",
  "Bet the boss would\nagree with me, too.": "",
  "Y'know, that wasn't as bad\nas I was expecting.": "",
  "Should we take him up on that offer?\nSkip town, wait 'til it all blows over?": "",
  "So, think we should listen to him\nand skip town?": "",
  "Don't be an idiot.": "",
  "Heh, just joking.": "",
  "Anyway, sounds like Hamura's got men\nlooking for us. And they're out for blood.": "",
  "Anyway, sounds like Hamura's got men looking for us.\nAnd they're out for blood.": "",
  "What do you mean, \"so what\"?": "",
  "If they wanna find us so bad, let 'em find us.\nAnyone who comes our way's in for a world of hurt.": "",
  "Well, if Hamura wants us so bad, let 'em find us.\nAnyone who comes our way's in for a world of hurt.": "",
  "And once we capture 'em,\nwe can force 'em to tell us where Hamura is.": "",
  "Then, we just get 'em to cough up\nHamura's location, and we're good.": "",
  "How're you so confident? They might kill us\nbefore we get a chance to fight.": "",
  "How're you so confident?\nThey might kill us before we get a chance to fight.": "",
  "Maybe even gouge our eyes out.": "",
  "Then what, you wanna just sit in the car\nwith Sugiura in the non-smoking section?": "",
  "So you'd rather sit in Sugiura's\nnon-smoking car?": "",
  "Yeah that doesn't sound\nso good either.": "",
  "Yeah, that doesn't sound\nso good either.": "",
  "Damn right it doesn't.\nNow go walk around a bit.": "",
  "Right? Now... Let's go take a walk.\nGrab some attention.": "",
  "I'll be watching from behind.": "",
  "Oh, and try and make yourself\nlook like an easy target.": "",
  "We wanna bait them into jumping us.\nMake yourself look like an easy target.": "",
  "And how exactly am I gonna do that?": "",
  "I get what you're saying, but...\nhow do I do that?": "",
  "Beats me.\nI'm sure you can think of somethin'.": "",
  "I'm sure you can think of somethin'.": "",
  "Yo, Tak. Can you hear me?": "",
  "Yo. Can you hear me, Tak?": "",
  "I've got your back.": "",
  "I've got your back\nfrom over here.": "",
  "Just go wherever,\nand try to look vulnerable.": "",
  "Just go wherever, and try to\nlook vulnerable.": "",
  "Nice going, Tak.\nYou look weak as shit out there.": "",
  "Nice going, Tak.\nYou look weak as hell out there.": "",
  "You're like a baby sheep or somethin'.\nHow are you even doing that?": "",
  "This is incredible!\nYou're like a baby sheep or somethin'.": "",
  "...Can you not?\nThis is how I always walk.": "",
  "Can you chill out?\nI'm just walking normally.": "",
  "Heh. Sorry, sorry. And don't worry,\nyou're in the clear for now.": "",
  "Don't mind me. And you're in the clear\nfor now, don't worry.": "",
  "I hope you're watching...": "",
  "Really? I hope you're watching...": "",
  "I am, I am.": "",
  "Hey, I got this.": "",
  "We don't know what's gonna happen next, though.\nYou might wanna grab a bite while you still can.": "",
  "Thanks for the heads up.": "",
  "Look at those assholes. You could wipe\nthe floor with 'em no problem.": "",
  "You could wipe the floor with\nthese thugs, no problem.": "",
  "...You're sure?": "",
  "What, can't you tell?\nThis is all you, man.": "",
  "You <font_kind=yakuza_italic>can</font_kind> handle it, yeah?": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. I'll be fine.": "",
  "All right already. I'll be fine.": "",
  "Those scrubs ain't Matsugane guys.": "",
  "Take a closer look at those scrubs.\nThey ain't Matsugane guys.": "",
  "Which means Tak's flyin' solo\non this one.": "",
  "Which means you can take 'em.": "",
  "You make it sound so easy!": "",
  "Don't make it sound so easy!": "",
  "These dicks got nothin' on you, Tak.": "",
  "Good luck. I'm gonna hang back.\nKeep watch, y'know?": "",
  "Now, I'm gonna hang back.\nKeep watch, y'know?": "",
  "Okay, okay...": "",
  "Hey Tak.\nWhy do you get in so many fights?": "",
  "Dude, why do you get in\nso many fights?": "",
  "Beats me.\nPeople just wanna hit me, I guess.": "",
  "People just wanna hit me, I guess.": "",
  "You've gotta start lookin' tougher, man.\nMake it so nobody even <font_kind=yakuza_italic>dares</font_kind> step up on you.": "",
  "Man, you've gotta start lookin' tougher.\nMake it so nobody even <font_kind=yakuza_italic>dares</font_kind> step up on you.": "",
  "Well excuse the hell out of me.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "What do you mean...?": "หมายความว่าไงเหรอ...?",
  "My bad.": "โทษที",
  "Don't be an idiot.": "อย่าทำตัวโง่ไปหน่อยเลย",
  "I've got your back.": "ฉันคอยหนุนหลังนายเอง",
